## 11. Items

### Inventory

- Six item slots, plus a six-slot stash. Backpack: three slots, see section 21.
- Consumables stack. Stock-limited items have a restock timer (Observer Ward, Smoke, Tome, Infused Raindrops).
- Sell-back: full refund within 10 s of purchase, 50% after that. Aegis-analog and Cheese-analog cannot be sold.
- Drop-on-death items: Rapier and Gem. Their holder drops them on death, visible to all.
- Items that take an active use a shared item cooldown per item, not per hero.

### Component tree

Twelve components. Tier 1 and Tier 2 components combine into finished items. Tier 3 and Tier 4 finished items combine finished items with components.

| Component | Tier | Effect |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Cheap Dagger | 1 | Bonus damage |
| Drafted Note | 1 | Bonus mana |
| Sticky Note | 1 | Ward component (vision) |
| Hot Sauce Bottle | 1 | Small heal |
| Ring Light | 1 | Vision radius +50 |
| Envelope | 1 | Courier speed +10% |
| Old Hoodie | 1 | Bonus armor |
| Rubber Duck | 2 | Attack speed |
| Burner Phone | 2 | Spell amplification |
| Charger | 2 | Mana regeneration |
| Cold Brew | 2 | Health regeneration |
| Tripod | 2 | Attack range |

Finished items by tier (built from the components):

- **Tier 1:** Lurker Cam (Sticky Note + Ring Light), Dust of Receipts (Drafted Note + Sticky Note), Hot Sauce (Hot Sauce Bottle + Drafted Note), Link in Bio Scroll (Envelope + Old Hoodie), Envelope With Legs (Envelope + Sticky Note), Magic Enthusiast (Drafted Note + Hot Sauce Bottle).
- **Tier 2:** Spoiler Tag, Ragequit Dagger, Gem of Subtext, Bottle of Copium, Smoke of Deniability, Mindfulness, Snack Tango, Ambient Focus, Boots of Scrolling, Anon Mask.
- **Tier 3:** Participation Trophy, Heart of Brainrot, Sleep Mode, Reply All, Co-Working Space, Rescheduled, Pro Plan, Dunk, Heavenly Feedback, Ghost Mode, Drain Blade.
- **Tier 4:** Refresh Page, Rapier Unironic, Dark Mode Shield, Spotlight, Sponsored Style, Monetized, Sheep Check.

Cost bands (to set in the balance pass):

| Tier | Cost band (gold) |
| --- | --- |
| Component 1 | 75 to 150 |
| Component 2 | 200 to 300 |
| Finished tier 1 | 300 to 500 |
| Finished tier 2 | 600 to 1,000 |
| Finished tier 3 | 1,400 to 2,400 |
| Finished tier 4 | 3,000 to 6,000 |

### Item roster

Every item maps to a classic original by function. Renamed items are marked.

| Brainrot item | Original hero item | Function | Flavor |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| Ragequit Dagger | Blink Dagger | Blink, short disengage | Logs off from your current position. |
| Participation Trophy | Aegis of the Immortal | One revive at the Fountain | Everyone gets one. |
| Refresh Page | Refresher Orb | Resets all cooldowns | Results may vary. |
| Rapier, Unironic | Divine Rapier | High-value item, drops on death | Dropped on death. Visible to all. |
| Gem of Subtext | Gem of True Sight | Reveals invisible units and wards | Reads between the lines. |
| Bottle of Copium | Bottle | Restores HP and mana over time | You are fine for 10 seconds afterward. |
| Heart of Brainrot | Heart of Tarrasque | Large HP pool. Nearby allies gain 5% less Clout. | Your allies are slightly less sure of themselves. |
| Lurker Cam | Observer Ward | Vision. Enemies see the reveal, earn no Clout. | Watching, not posting. |
| Spoiler Tag | Sentry Ward | True sight ward | Reveals what is hidden. Also what is coming. |
| Dust of Receipts | Dust of Appearance | Reveals invisible units in radius | The proof is in the dust. |
| Smoke of Deniability | Smoke of Deceit | Invisibility cloud for allies | Nothing happened here. |
| Snack Tango | Tango | Heals, restores trees | Responsibly sourced. |
| Ambient Focus | Clarity | Restores mana over time | A gentle reminder to keep going. |
| Hot Sauce | Faerie Fire | Instant heal | Not for beginners. |
| Link in Bio Scroll | Town Portal Scroll | Teleports to base | Stay a while. |
| Boots of Scrolling | Boots of Speed | Movement speed | Infinite scroll, finite boots. |
| Sleep Mode | Power Treads | Toggles attribute and movement | Switch modes. Never fully off. |
| Dark Mode Shield | Black King Bar | Brief spell immunity | Works everywhere. |
| Reply All | Blade Mail | Reflects damage | Everyone sees what you said. |
| Co-Working Space | Mekansm | Heal aura for the team | Good vibes, shared desk. |
| **Anon Mask** | Shadow Blade (renamed from Anonymous Blade) | Fade, invisibility on use | Nobody knows who did this. |
| Spotlight | Radiance | Burns nearby enemies | Everyone is looking. |
| Sponsored Style | Manta Style | Creates illusions | Duplicates you. Disclosed. |
| Rescheduled | Eul's Scepter | Disables and displaces | Moved to a later time. |
| Pro Plan | Aghanim's Scepter (upgrade item) | Upgrades one ability or ultimate per hero | Upgrade unlocked. |
| Monetized | Hand of Midas | Converts creep kills to gold | Gold from creeps. Also from attention. |
| Sheep Check | Sheepstick | Hex on the target | Deliberate. Sheepish. |
| Dunk | Orchid Malevolence | Silence and bonus damage | Silenced. Still right. |
| Heavenly Feedback | Heaven's Halberd | Disarms and slows | Feedback delivered in person. |
| Magic Enthusiast | Magic Wand | Heals and grants magic resistance | Charges from every spell. |
| Ghost Mode | Phase Boots | Phases through units while moving | Not here. Not now. |
| Envelope With Legs | Courier | Delivers items to base | Late. Always. |

Design notes:

- Anon Mask replaces Anonymous Blade. It is an invisibility item (Shadow Blade analog). It is not a blink, and the name now matches the function.
- The PA ability Anonymous Dagger keeps its name, since it throws a dagger.
- Pro Plan is the one ultimate upgrade per hero. It is the Scepter analog, and is named for what it does.
- Attack-modifier stacking rules are simplified. Orbs do not stack, which keeps the rule simple.

