| 03 | The Reply Guy | Harasser, zoner | Forward diagonal | Mustard | Raised index finger | Corrects everything, including own abilities |
| 04 | The Algorithm-Pilled Carry | Late-game carry | Rigid vertical rectangle | Cold teal | Chart-line spine plate | Optimizes everything, enjoys nothing |
| 05 | The Doomscroller | Ranged nuker | Long stooped horizontal | Night blue | Paper scroll trailing to the floor | Abilities load more |
| 06 | The Notification Support | Healer, buffer | Small circle | Soft green-cyan | Badge dot over head | Means well, interrupts constantly |
| 07 | The Moderator | Tank, initiator | Big square | Grey with team color | Gavel-shaped stamp | Bureaucratic calm while doing violence |
| 08 | The Ghost Account | Illusionist, summoner | Stacked circles, opaque | Pale lavender | Blank default avatar head | Zero posts, 40k followers |
| 09 | The Hot Take | Burst initiator | Sharp triangle | Desaturated ember | Megaphone shoulder | Every opinion at emergency volume |
| 10 | The Archivist | Utility, zone control | Wide rectangle | Sepia | Filing-cabinet backpack | Has receipts for everything |
| 11 | The Parasocial | Tethered support, dueler | Two linked circles | Rose | Framed photo of the enemy carry | Insists they are close friends |
| 12 | The Touch-Grass Hermit | Jungler, sustain | Rounded mound | Moss green | Wearing actual turf | Offline, smug, healthier |

Each variant differs from the others in at least two of: body proportion, prop silhouette, primary value group. A hooded Lurker, a Lurker in a collar and a Lurker in a blanket fort share an archetype and read as three heroes.

